    // must revert if and only if newOwner == address(0). The mutant removed the require, so passing address(0)
    // will succeed on the mutant but revert on the reference. We fuzz newOwner to let the fuzzer find address(0).
    function testFuzz_property(address newOwner) public {
        // keep domain wide; but we must ensure msg.sender is the owner (setUp used address(this) as owner)
